  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="dc50e299-9e5b-5499-8464-a20b4c343c73" activityNameId="c4776f63-9fee-55ad-b367-aa308768836a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Nitrogen, liquid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Nitrogen, liquid, at plant
The liquefaction process of air represent an average cryogenic air separation process. As products only liquid nitrogen, liquid oxygen and liquid crude argon were considered. No gaseous product considered. The allocation factors were calculated from the heat of vaporisation and the specific heat capacity multiplied with the temperature difference from 20°C to the boiling point. Multi output process. The allocated outputs are liquid nitrogen, liquid oxygen and liquid crude argon.;
Formula: N2, O2, Ar; 
UUID: a2bbcfbc-5d63-3e86-9bab-8d4c2b6fdbc0
Electricity for process, cooling water and waste heat. Infrastructure for air separation plant.
Location: Data from several producer in europe. Data from U.S. and Russian plant producer.
Technology: Cryogenic air separation. Average energy demand refers to large separation plant under operating conditions or a small plant under optimal conditions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data on energy demand and water ressources based on several data sources of different plant size. Infrastructure demand estimated from data of small plants. 
Extrapolations: Energy data of good representativity. Cooling water demand and Infrastructure extrapolated from technology of lower representativity.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a2bbcfbc-5d63-3e86-9bab-8d4c2b6fdbc0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
